.TH COSMOS-CAMERA-SETUP-HOST 1 "November 2026" "Cosmos Camera" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cosmos-camera-setup-host \- configure Jetson Docker runtime and user access
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sudo cosmos-camera-setup-host
.SH DESCRIPTION
Enables Docker and registers the NVIDIA runtime if absent, restarting Docker
when registration is needed. Adds the invoking desktop user to the docker and
video groups. The user is determined from PKEXEC_UID or SUDO_UID.
Drivers and JetPack must already be installed.
.SH NOTES
The docker group grants administrator-level capabilities. Restarting Docker
may affect other containers. After adding groups, log out of the desktop and
log in again. The first-run dialog can invoke this helper through graphical
administrator authorization. Package installation does not run it automatically.
This helper does not download models or start inference.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cosmos-camera (1)
